ttings.\r\n\r\n### Performance\r\n- Performance remains unchanged on systems with sufficient memory.\r\n- Low-memory mode may slightly reduce performance due to its smaller upload buffer.\r\n\r\n### Known Issues\r\n- Some systems with 16 GB RAM may still experience crashes or become stuck on the loading screen, particularly when loading certain saves.\r\n- Further memory optimisation is being investigated to improve stability on systems with limited memory.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SuperCatElvis/UntilDawn_PC/releases/446472993/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}